<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="REV" style="id">Thupuan</book>
  <para style="h">Thupuan</para>
  <para style="toc1">Thupuan</para>
  <para style="toc2">Thupuan</para>
  <para style="mt">Thupuan</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Isua Krista thupuan hi thil lo thleng thuai tûr, a bawihte hriat atân Pathian pêk a ni; chu chu Isuan Vântirhkoh tîrin, a bawih Johana hnênah a hrilh lâwk a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />ani chuan Pathian thu leh Isua thu a dawn ang ang chu a puang ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />He lehkhabu chhiartu leh a chhûnga hrilh lâwkna thute lo bengkhawna zâwmtute chu an nihlawh e, hun a thleng ṭêp si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Johana chuan Asia rama kohhran pasarihte chibai a bûk e. Awm mêka leh awm tawha leh lo kal tûra leh a lalṭhutthlêng hmaa thlarau pasarih leh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Isua Krista, thuhretu rinawm, mitthi zînga tho hmasa ber, leia lalte chunga hotu hnên aṭangin khawngaihna leh remna in hnênah awm rawh se. Min hmangaiha, a thisena kan sualte min sil faisaktu,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />lala min siama, a pa Pathian tân puithiama min siamtu hnênah, ama hnên ngeiah chuan ropuina leh thuneihna chatuanin awm rawh se. Amen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ngai teh, chhûm zîngah a lo kal e, mit tinrêngin an hmu ang, amah chhuntute ngei pawhin an hmu ang. Khawvêla hnam tinrêngin amah an ṭah bawk ang: Ni e. Amen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Kei Alfa leh Omega chu ka ni,” Lalpa Pathian, Engkimtitheia, awm mêka leh awm tawha leh lo kal tûra chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kei Johana, in unau, Isua avânga tihduhdahna chhel taka tuarpuitu che u leh, a lalna ṭâwmpuitu che u hi, Pathian thu avâng leh Isua thu ka hril avângin Patmos an tih thliarkârah ka awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Lalpa ni-ah chuan thlarauvin ka lo awm a. Tawtawrâwt ri ang maia ring ka hnung lamah aw ka hria a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“I thil hmuh hi lehkhabuah ziak la, kohhran pasarih - Efesi kohhran te, Smurna kohhran te, Pergamos kohhran te, Thuatira kohhran te, Sardis kohhran te, Filadelfia kohhran te leh Laodikei kohhran te thawn rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mi betu hmuh tuma ka han lehhawi chuan, rangkachak khâwnvâr zâr sarih ka hmu a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />chûng zîngah chuan mihring ang, kelêr thlenga kawrfual ha rangkachak kâwnghrên hrêng ka hmu a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />a sam chu sahmul vâr tak ang, vûr ang maia vâr a ni a, a mit chu meialh ang a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A ke chu dâr tle mi, meia rawh thianghlim ang a ni a, a aw chu tuifinriat ri hum hum ang hi a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A kut ding lamin arsi pasarih a keng a, a ka aṭangin khandaih hriam tawn hriam tak a lo chhuak a, a hmêl chu ni sat vânglai tak anga êng a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ani chu ka hmuh veleh thi ang maiin a ke bulah ka tlu ta a. A kut ding lam ka chungah a rawn nghat a, “Hlau suh, Hmasabera leh Hnuhnûngbera,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Minunga chu ka ni, ka thi a; nimahsela, ngai teh, tûnah zawng chatuana nung tûrin ka lo tho leh ta a; thihna leh mitthi khaw chabite ka nei a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />I thil hmuh tâkte, thil awm mêk leh thil lo thleng tûrte chu ziak rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ka kut ding lama arsi pasarih leh, rangkachak khâwnvâr zâr sarih i hmuhte awmze ril chu hei hi a ni: Arsi pasarih hi kohhran pasarih tirhkohte an ni a, khâwnvâr zâr sarih hi kohhran pasarihte an ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Efesi khaw kohhran tirhkoh hnênah heti hian ziak rawh: ‘A kut ding lama arsi pasarih kenga, rangkachak khâwnvâr dahna pasarih zînga vei veia khân heti hian a ti:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />I thiltihte ka hria, i thawhrimzia te, i chhelzia te, mi sual i ngaihtheih lohzia te, tirhkoh ni si lo tirhkoh invuahte chu i fiah a, a der an nih i hriat tâk thu te ka hria.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />I chhel êm êm a, ka hming avângin i tuar a, i beidawng lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nimahsela, demna che ka nei: a tîra mi hmangaih ang khân mi hmangaih ta lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />I tlûksan tâk kha ngaihtuah teh; sim la, a tîra i tih ang kha ti leh rawh. Chutilo zawng, i hnênah ka lo kal ang a, i sim loh chuan a awmna ata i khâwnvâr chu ka sawn daih ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nikola-ho thil tih, ka huatzâwng i haw ve hi erawh chu i ti ṭha e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Thlarauvin kohhranho hnêna thu a sawi hi hriat theihna beng nei chuan ngaithla ngun rawh se. A hnehtu apiang chu Pathian paradis-a awm nunna thing rahin ka châwm ang.’
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Smurna khaw kohhran tirhkoh hnênah pawh heti hian ziak rawh: ‘Hmasabera leh Hnuhnûngbera, thi-a nung leh ta-a khân heti hian a ti:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />I tuarnate ka hria, i pachhe na a, i hausak si hi. Juda ni lo Juda inti, Setana sunagog-a miten an sawichhiat dân che pawh ka hria.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />I thil tuarte chu hlau suh. Ngai teh, in zînga mi ṭhenkhat chu tân ina khungin, Diabola chuan a fiah dâwn a che u, ni sâwm chhûng in tuar ang. Thih thlengin rinawm takin awm zêl la, chawimawina lukhum, nunna chu ka pe ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Thlarauvin kohhrante hnêna a sawi hi hriat theihna beng nei chuan ngaithla ngun rawh se. A hnehtu apiang thih hnihna chuan eng mah a tih lo vang.’
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Pergamos khaw kohhran tirhkoh hnênah pawh heti hian ziak rawh: ‘Khandaih hriam tawn neia chuan heti hian a ti:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Setana lalṭhuthlêng hûnna hmunah i awm tih ka hria; mahse, ka hming i ṭan tlata, ka thuhretu rinawm Antipa, Setana awmna hmuna an thah lai pawh khân, mi rinna i thlah chuang lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, tlêmin demna che ka nei: In zîngah mi ṭhenkhat Balaama zirtîrna vuan tlat in awm. Ani chuan Balaka chu Israel fate hruai sual dân a zirtîr a, Israel fate chu milem biakna sa ei tûr leh inngaihna suala tlu tûrin a hruai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Chutiang bawkin, in zîngah Nikola zirtîrna vuan tlat in awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Sim ula, chutilo chuan in hnênah ka lo kal thuai dâwn, chûng thil titute chu ka kâa khandaih hian ka rawn bei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Thlarauvin kohhrante hnêna thu a sawi hi hriat theihna beng nei chuan ngaithla ngun rawh se. A hnehtu apiang mana thuhrûk ka pe ang a, lungvâr ka pe bawk ang; chu lungah chuan mi dang tu ma hriat loh, a dawngtu chauh hriat tûr hming thar a chuang a ni.’
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Thuatira khaw kohhran tirhkoh hnênah pawh heti hian ziak rawh: ‘Pathian Fapa, meialh ang mit nei, dâr tle mi ang ke neia chuan heti hian a ti:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />I thil tihte ka hria, mi hmangaihzia te, i rinawmzia te, i rawngbâwl dân te, i dawhtheihzia te, a tîr aia tûna thil i tihṭhat zâwk tâkzia te ka hria.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, demna che ka nei; kha hmeichhia, Jezebeli, zâwlneia inchhâl kha i ngaihtheih avângin. Ani chuan ka bawihte milem biakna sa eia inngaih chîng tûrin a zirtîr a, a hruai bo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A sim nân hun ka pe a, inngaih a chîn a thlah chuang lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ngai rawh, khumbetin ka nattîr dâwn, an thil chîn an sim loh chuan a uirepuite pawh nasa takin ka timangang ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Amah zuitute pawh ka tihlum ngei dâwn; tichuan, kohhranten mite thinlung leh rilru hre vektu ka ni tih an hria ang. In thil tih ang zêl ṭheuhvin ka rûl ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />‘Thuatira khaw mi dangte erawh zawngin he zirtîrna hi in zâwm ve lo va, ‘Setana thu ril’ an tihte pawh in pawm ve loh avângin phurrit ka belhchhah lo vang che u, ka ti a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ka lo kal leh hma chu in thil neih sa kha vawng tlat rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />A tâwp thlenga ka duh zâwng ti tlattu, hnehtu chu Jentail-te chunga thuneihna ka pe ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />An chungah thîrtiang hmangin ro a rêl ang a, hlumbêl angin a vaw sawm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Pa hnên ata ka dawn vârparh arsi chu ka pe bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Thlarauvin kohhrante hnêna thu a sawi hi hriat theihna beng nei chuan ngaithla ngun rawh se.’
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Sardis khaw kohhran tirhkoh hnênah pawh heti hian ziak rawh: ‘Pathian Thlarau pasarih leh arsi pasarih neia chuan heti hian a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />I thil tihte ka hria; thi reng siin nunga i than hi; intiharh la, i thil neih thi lek lekte chu tinung leh rawh. I thiltihte chu ka Pathian mit tlung zo a awm lo va ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tichuan, an zirtîr che leh i thu dawnte kha hre rengin zâwm la, i sual kha sim rawh. I harh loh erawh chuan rûkru angin ka lo kal ang a, i hnên ka lo thlen hun i hre lo dah ang e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Sardis khuaa mi ṭhenkhat erawh chu an thawmhnaw tibawlhhlawh lo an awm, chûng chu kawrfual vâr ha-in ka hnênah an lêng ve ang, chutianga awm tlâk chu an ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hnehtute chuan chutiang chuan kawrfual vâr an ha ang a, nunna bua an hming chuang chu ka thai bo lo vang. Ka Pa leh vântirhkohte hmaah anni chu ka ṭan ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Thlarauvin kohhrante hnêna thu a sawi hi hriat theihna beng nei chuan ngaithla ngun rawh se.’
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Filadelfia khaw kohhran tirhkoh hnênah pawh heti hian ziak rawh: ‘Thianghlima leh Dika, Davida chabi neia, tu ma khâr theih loh tûra kawngkhâr hawnga, tu ma hawn theih loh tûra khâra chuan heti hian a ti:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />I thiltihte ka hria, chakna tlêm tê chauh i nei na a, ka thu i vawng tlat a, tu ma khâr theih loh tûr i hmaah kawngka ka hawng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, Setana sunagog-a mi, mi dawthei, Juda ni si lova Juda intite chu hruaiin i hmaah ka rawn kûntîr dâwn; nang hi ka hmangaih chu i ni tih an hre tawh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Chhel taka awm tûra thu ka pêk che i vawn avângin leia chêng zawng zawng fiah nân khawvêl puma hremna lo thlen hunah kei pawhin ka humhim ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka lo kal thuai dâwn e, i thil neih sa kha vawng tlat la; tichuan, tu man chawimawina lukhum i chan tûr chu an chhuhsak lo vang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A hnehtu apiang chu ka Pathian Tempul banah ka phun ang a, chuta ta chu sawn an ni tawh lo vang. Pa Pathian hming anmahniah chuan a chuang ang a, Pathian khawpui Jerusalem thar, ka Pathian hnên ata lo chhuk hming leh ka hming thar chu anmahniah ka ziak bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Thlarauvin kohhrante hnêna thu a sawi hi hriat theihna beng nei chuan ngaithla ngun rawh se.’
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Laodikei khaw kohhran tirhkoh hnênah pawh heti hian ziak rawh: ‘Amena, Thuhretu rinawma leh Dika, Pathian thil siam zawng zawng bula chuan heti hian a ti:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />I thiltihte ka hria, i vâwt lo va, i lum hek lo; i vawh emaw, i lum emaw ka duh a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Vawt si lo, lum pep pup chauh i nih avângin ka kâ ata ka chhâk chhuak ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />‘Ka hausa a, engkim ka ngah a, tlâkchham ka nei lo,’ i ti vei a; rethei khawngaihthlâk, pachhia, mitdel leh saruak mai i ni tih i inhre si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tichuan, i hausak theih nân rangkachak meia rawh thianghlim ka hnên aṭanga lei tûrin ka râwn a che. I saruak zahpuiawm tak khuh tûrin i hâk atân kawr vâr lei la, i hmuh theih nân mit na damdawi lei bawk rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ka hmangaihte chu ka zilhin ka thunun ṭhîn; chuvângin, ka thu awih la, sim rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ngai teh, kawngkhâr bula dingin ka kik hi, tu pawh ka aw hriaa kawng mi hawnsaktu hnênah chuan ka lût ang a, zanriah ka ei ang a, ani pawhin ka hnênah a ei bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A hnehtute apiang ka lalṭhutthlêngah ka ṭhuttîr ang a; kei pawhin ka hneha, ka Pa bulah a lalṭhutthlênga ka ṭhu ang hian.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Thlarauvin kohhrante hnêna thu a sawi hi hriat theihna beng nei chuan ngaithla ngun rawh se.’ ”
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chûng hnu chuan ka han en a, vâna kawngka inhawng ka hmu a, tawtawrâwt ri ang aw, mi bia ka hriat tawh khân, “Hetah hian lo chho la, tûn hnua thil lo awm ngei tûr ka entîr ang che,” mi ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Thlarauvin ka awm ta nghâl a. Vânah chuan lalṭhutthlêng a lo awm a, tah chuan mi pakhat a ṭhu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A hmêl chu Jaspi leh Sardion lung ang a ni a, lalṭhutthlêng vêlah chuan Samaragdin lung rawng ang chhimbâl a zâm kual a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Lalṭhutthlêng hual chuan lalṭhutthlêng dang sawmhnih leh pali a inhûng a, tah chuan upa sawmhnih leh pali an ṭhu a, a vârin an inthuam a, rangkachaka siam chawimawina lukhum an khum bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Lalṭhutthlêng aṭang chuan kâwl a phe a, aw te, khawpui te a lo ri chhuak dur dur a. Lalṭhutthlêng hmaah chuan meichher pasarih a alh hluah hluah a, chûng chu Pathian thlarau pasarihte an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Lalṭhutthlêng hma lamah chuan tuifinriat ang dârthlalang, krustal lung anga fîm a awm bawk a. A laia lalṭhutthlêng vêlah chuan hnung lam leh hma lam mita khat, thilnung pali an ding kual a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Thilnung pakhatna chu Sakeibaknei ang a ni a, thilnung pahnihna chu bâwngpa ang a ni a, thilnung pathumna chu mihring hmêl ang pu a ni a, thilnung palina chu mupui thlâwk lai ang a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Thilnung palite chuan thla paruk an nei ṭheuh va, an pâwn lam leh an chhûng lam chu mitin a khat bawk a: “Lalpa Pathian, Engkimtitheia, awm tawha leh awm mêka leh lo kal tûra chu a thianghlim e, a thianghlim e, a thianghlim e,” tia auvin chhun leh zân an châwl lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Thilnung palite chuan lalṭhutthlênga ṭhu, chatuana nung renga chu an chawimawia, an faka, lâwmthu an hrilh apiangin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />lalṭhutthlênga ṭhu-a hmaah chuan upa sawmhnih leh palite chu an bawkkhup a, chatuana nung renga chu chibai an bûk ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Lalṭhutthlêng hmaah chuan an lu-a chawimawina lukhum chu an dah a, “Nang, kan Lalpa leh kan Pathian, Ropuina te, chawimawina te, Thiltihtheihna te nei tlâk i ni e, Thil engkim i siam a, I thuin an lo awm a, din chhuah an lo ni,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lalṭhutthlênga ṭhu-a ding lamah chuan, pâwn lam leh chhûng lama ziak lehkhabu zial, chhinchhiahna pasariha châr tlat ka hmu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Vântirhkoh thiltithei tak ka hmu bawk a, “Tu nge lehkhabu zial hi hawnga, a chhinchhiahnate hi phelh tlâk awm?” tiin ring takin a tlângau va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Lehkhabu zial chu phelha, a chhûng en thei vânah tu mah an awm lo va, leiah leh lei hnuaiah pawh tu mah an awm hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Lehkhabu zial chu phelha en tlâk tu mah an awm loh avâng chuan ka ṭap ta zawih zawih a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Upa zînga pakhat chuan, “Ṭap teh suh, ngai teh, Juda hnama sakeibaknei, Davida thlaha mi khân chhinchhiahna chu phelh tûr leh, lehkhabu zial chu pharh tûrin a hneh ta,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, thilnung pali leh upaho ṭhut hual, a laia lalṭhutthlêngah chuan, Berâmno talh tawh ni âwm tak ding ka hmu a. Berâmno chuan mit pasarih leh ki pasarih, lei hmun tina tirh chhuah ṭhin, Pathian thlarau pasarih chu a nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Lalṭhutthlênga ṭhu-a ding lama lehkhabu zial chu la tûrin a lo kal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A han lâk chuan thilnung palite leh upa sawmhnih leh palite chu Berâmno hmaah chuan an bawkkhup a, perhkhuang leh rangkachak berhbu, rimtui mi thianghlimte ṭawngṭainaa khat chu an keng ṭheuh va,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />hla thar an sa a: “Nang, lehkhabu zial chu laa, a chhinchhiahna phelh tlâk i ni e. I thi a, i thisenin hnam tin, ṭawng tin, mi tin leh Jentail-te, Pathian tân i lei a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Lalah te, kan Pathian tân puithiamah te i siam a. Lei chungah an lal ang,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka en reng a, lalṭhutthlêng leh thilnung leh upaho din huala vântirhkoh rual, a sînga sîng, a sânga sâng rual tam tak aw ka hria a, ring takin an au va,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Berâmno talh tawha chu, Thiltihtheihna te, hausakna te, finna te, chakna te, chawimawina te, Ropuina te, fakna te dawng tlâk a ni e,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Thil nung tinrêng, vâna mi te, leia mi te, lei hnuaia mi te, tuifinriat leh a chhûnga awm zawng zawng te au thâwm ka hre bawk a, “Lalṭhutthlênga ṭhu-a leh Berâmno chuan fakna te, chawimawina te, ropuina te, Thiltihtheihna te chatuanin nei rawh se,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Thilnung palite chuan, ‘Amen,’ an lo ti a, upate pawh chuan bawkkhupin chibai an bûk a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Berâmno chuan chhinchhiahna pasarih zînga pakhat a phelh lai chu ka hmu a, thilnung pali zînga pakhat chuan khawpui ri ang maia auvin, “Lo chhuak rawh,” a tih ka hria a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka han en a, sakawr vâr ka hmu a, a chunga chuang chuan thalngul a keng a, chawimawina lukhum an khumtîr a, hneh zêl tûrin hnehtu chu a chhuak ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Chhinchhiahna pahnihna a han phelh a, thilnung pahnihna chuan, “Lo chhuak rawh,” a tih ka hria a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka han en a, sakawr dang, a sen a lo chhuak a. A chunga chuang chu insâmpui a thlen theih nân lei ata remna lâk bo theihna an pe a, khandaih lian pui mai an pe bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Chhinchhiahna pathumna a han phelh leh a, thilnung pathumna chuan, “Lo chhuak rawh,” a tih ka hria a. Ngai teh, kan han en chuan sakawr dum ka hmu a. A chunga chuang chuan a kutin bûkna a keng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Thilnung palite zîng aṭanga chhuak ni âwm tak aw ka hria a, “Ni khat hlawhin buhpui kg. khat, ni khat hlawhin barli kg. Thum; uain leh hriak chu khawih tel suh,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chhinchhiahna palina a han phelh a, thilnung palina chuan, “Lo chhuak rawh,” a tih ka hria a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka han en a, ngai teh, sakawr dâng ka hmu a, a chunga chuang hming chu Thihnaa a ni a, Mitthikhuaan a rawn zui a. Ngûnhnâm te, ṭâm te, hri te, ram sakawlh te hmanga tihlum tûrin lei hmun li-a ṭhena hmun khat chunga thuneihna an pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chhinchhiahna pangana a han phelh a, Pathian thu avâng leh an thu hrilh avânga thah, mi thianghlimte thlarau chu maichâm hnuaiah ka hmu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Anni chu aw ring takin an au va, “Aw Lalpa ropui, mi thianghlim leh mi dik tak, engtikah nge lei mite chunga ro i rêl anga, kan thisen phuba chu min lâksak dâwn?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kawrfual vâr an pe ṭheuh va, an bawihpuite leh an unaute, anmahni ang bawka thah an nih hma chu lo nghâk rih tûrin an hrilh ta bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chhinchhiahna parukna a han phelh chuan lîr a nghîng ta chiam a, sahmul puan dum ang maiin ni a lo thim a, thla chu thisen angin a sen bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Thlipuiin theipui hel a nuai ṭîl ang maiin arsite chu leiah a tla chum chum a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Vân chu lehkhabu anga zial bo a ni a, tlângte leh thliarkâr zawng zawng chu sawn an ni ta vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tichuan, leia lalte, hotute, sipai hotute, mi hausa leh mi thiltitheite leh mi dang, bawih leh bawih lote pawh chu pûkah te, tlânga lungpui phênah te an biru a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tlâng leh lungpui te hnênah chuan, “Lalṭhutthlênga ṭhu-a mit hmuh ata leh Berâmno thinurna lak ata min delh ula, min khuh rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />An thinurna râpthlâk tak chu a lo thleng ta si a, tu nge tuar zo vang?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chûng hnuah chuan lei kil li-ah vântirhkoh pali ding ka hmu a, lei chungah te, tuifinriat chungah te, thing chungah te thli a tleh loh nân thli palite chu an chelh tlat a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Vântirhkoh dang, Pathian nung chhinchhiahna keng, khawchhak lama lo chhuak ka hmu bawk a; lei leh tuifinriat tihchhiat theihna an pêk vântirhkoh palite chu ring takin a han au va,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Kan Pathian bawihte chala kan chhinchhiah zawh hma chu lei te, tuifinriat te, thing te eng mah tih suh u,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Israela fa, hnam sâwm leh pahnih zînga mi an chhinchhiah zât chu, mi nuaikhat leh sîngli leh sângli an ni tih an sawi ka hria; hetiangin:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Juda hnama mi sîngkhat leh sânghnih, Reubena hnama mi sîngkhat leh sânghnih, Gada hnama mi sîngkhat leh sânghnih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Asera hnama mi sîngkhat leh sânghnih, Naftalia hnama mi sîngkhat leh sânghnih, Manasea hnama mi sîngkhat leh sânghnih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Sumeona hnama mi sîngkhat leh sânghnih, Levia hnama mi sîngkhat leh sânghnih, Isakara hnama mi sîngkhat leh sânghnih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Zebuluna hnama mi sîngkhat leh sânghnih, Josefa hnama mi sîngkhat leh sânghnih, Benjamina hnama mi sîngkhat leh sânghnih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chûng hnuah chuan mipui nasa tak tu ma chhiar sên loh, Jentail-te leh hnam tin, mi tin, ṭawng tina mi ka hmu a, tûmkaute kenga kawrfual vâr ha-in lalṭhutthlêng leh Berâmno hmaah chuan an ding a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ring takin an au va: “Chhandamna chu kan Pathian Lalṭhutthlênga ṭhu leh Berâmno hnêna mi a ni,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Vântirhkoh zawng zawng chu lalṭhutthlêng leh upate leh thilnung palite hualin an ding a, lalṭhutthlêng hmaah chuan an bawkkhup a, Pathian chibai an bûk a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Amen, Fakna te, ropuina te, finna te, Lâwmthu sawina te, chawimawina te, thiltihtheihna te leh Chakna te kumkhuain kan Pathian ta a ni, Amen,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Upa zînga pakhat chuan, “Hêng kawrfual vâr hate hi tute nge ni-a, khawi lam aṭanga lo kal nge an nih?” tiin mi zâwt a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Kei chuan ka chhâng a, “Ka pu, nangin i hre zâwk ang,” ka ti a. Ani chuan, “Hêng mite hi hrehawm nasa tak ata chhuak hote kha an ni a, an puante su faia, an silhfênte Berâmno thisena tivâr tate an nih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Chuvâng chuan, Pathian lalṭhutthlêng hmaah an awm a, a tempulah chuan a chhûn a zânin a rawng an bâwl ta a ni: Lalṭhutthlênga ṭhu-a chuan an chungah a puan in a zârsak dâwn si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />An rilṭâm leh tawh ngai lo vang a, an tuihâl tawh hek lo vang, ni sa an tuar ngai tawh lo vang a, khaw lumin a tihrehawm tawh hek lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Lalṭhutthlêng laia awm Berâmno chu anmahni vêngtu a ni ang a, nunna tuikhurah te chuan a hruai ang. Pathian chuan an mit ata mittui zawng zawng a hru fai ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, chhinchhiahna pasarihna a han phelh chuan dâr chanve lai vân chu a reh ta ṭhup a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Pathian hmaa vântirhkoh pasarih ding ka hmu a, tawtawrâwt pasarih an pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Vântirhkoh dang, rangkachak berhbu keng, lalṭhutthlêng hmaa rangkachak maichâmah chuan a lo kal a, mi thianghlimte ṭawngṭaina belhchhah nân rimtui hâl tûr an pe ṭeuh va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Vântirhkoh kuta rimtui hâl khu chu mi thianghlim ṭawngṭainate nên chuan Pathian hmaah a khu chho ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Vântirhkoh chuan berhbu chu a la a, maichâma meiling chu a khatin a rût a, leiah a paih thla a. Tichuan, khawpui a ri a, aw a lo chhuak a, kâwl a lo phe a, lîr te a lo nghîng ta dur dur a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, vântirhkoh pasarihte chuan tawtawrâwt an kente chu hâm tûrin an insiam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A hmasa ber chuan a han hâm a, rial leh mei, thisen nêna inpawlh leiah a tla ta chiam mai a. Lei hmun thuma ṭhena hmun khat leh thing hmun thuma ṭhena hmun khat chu a kâng ral a, hnimhring zawng zawng pawh a kâng ral vek bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Vântirhkoh pahnihna chuan a han hâm ve a, thil eng emaw, tlâng lian pui kâng hluah hluah ang hi tuifinriatah an paih thla a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuifinriat hmun thuma ṭhena hmun khat chu thisenah a chang ta a, tuifinriata nungcha awm zawng zawng hmun thuma ṭhena hmun khat chu an thi a, lawngte pawh hmun thuma ṭhena hmun khat chu a chhe ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Vântirhkoh pathumna chuan a han hâm ve a; arsi lian tak, meichher anga alh hluah hluah hi vân aṭangin a tla a, lui zawng zawng hmun thuma ṭhena hmun khatah leh tuikhurahte chuan a tla a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chu arsi hming chu ‘Khâ’ a ni. Chu chuan tui hmun thuma ṭhena hmun khat chu a tikhâ a, a khâk tâk êm avângin a in tam tak chuan an thih phah ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Vântirhkoh palina chuan a han hâm ve leh a; ni hmun thuma ṭhena hmun khat, thla hmun thuma ṭhena hmun khat, arsi pawh hmun thuma ṭhena hmun khat chu a chhia a, hmun thuma ṭhena hmun khat chu a thim ta a; ni pawhin a ênna hmun thuma ṭhena hmun khat a hloh va, zân pawhin chutiang bawkin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ka han en a, vânlaizâwlah mupui a lo thlâwk duai duai a, ring takin a hrâm tuar tuar a, “Vântirhkoh pathumten an tawtawrâwt an ham hun chuan leia chêngte tân a va râpthlâk dâwn êm! A va râpthlâk dâwn êm! A va râpthlâk dâwn êm!” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Vântirhkoh pangana chuan a han ham ve a, vân aṭanga leia tla arsi ka hmu a. A hnênah chuan leilâwt chabi an pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Leilâwt chu a han hawng a, a kua aṭang chuan meikhu ang mai a lo khu chhuak ngut ngut a, meikhu lo chhuak avâng chuan ni leh boruak a thim zo ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Meikhu aṭang chuan khau rual leiah an lo chhuak a, leia khawmualkaikuang thiltihtheihna ang thiltihtheihna an pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />An chala Pathian chhinchhiahna pu lo mihringte sawisak an phal a; leia hnim rêng rêng, thlai te, thing te erawh chu tichhe lo tûrin an hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Chhinchhiahna pu lote chu an tihhlum mai an phalsak lo, thla nga chhûng tihnat chauh an phalsak a; khawmualkaikuang angin an seh a na a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chûng ni-ah chuan miten thihna an zawng ang a, an hmu si lo vang; thih an châk ang a; mahse, thihna chuan a tlân bosan ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Khau lan dân chu indona atân sakawr an thuam ang hi a ni; an lu-ah chuan rangkachaka siam chawimawina lukhum ang hi a awm a, mihring hmêl ang an pu a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />hmeichhe sam anga sei sam an nei a, an hâ chu sakeibaknei hâ ang a ni;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />phuhlip, thîr-phaw ang an nei a, an thla zâp thâwm chu sakawr-tawlailîr tam tak indonaa tlân ri dur dur ang hi a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mei an nei bawk a, khawmualkaikuang angin mi an seh thei a, an seh chu thla nga chhûng a na a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />An lal chu leilâwt huai a ni a, Hebrai ṭawnga a hming chu ‘Abadona’ a ni, Grik ṭawng chuan ‘Apoluona,’ a ni, chu chu ‘Tiboraltua,’ tihna a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Thil râpthlâk pakhat chu a liam ta a, hêng zawhah hian thil râpthlâk dang pahnih a lo la awm dâwn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Vântirhkoh parukna chuan a han hâm ve leh a; Pathian hmaa rangkachak maichâm ki pali aṭang chuan aw ka hria a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />tawtawrâwt keng vântirhkoh parukna hnênah chuan, “Eufretis luipuia vântirhkoh pali phuarte khu chhuah rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tichuan, he kum, he thla, he ni leh dârkâra mihring hmun thuma ṭhena hmun khat that tûra buatsaih vântirhkoh palite chu an chhuah ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />An sipai sakawr chungchuang mite chu vaibêlchhetak hnih an ni tih mi sawi ka hria.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, inlârnaah chuan sakawr leh a chungchuangte chu hetiang hian ka hmu: mei anga sen, huakintho lung anga dumpâwl, kât anga êng âwmphaw an nei a; chûng sakawr lu chu sakeibaknei lu ang a ni a, an kâ aṭang chuan mei te, meikhu te, kât te a chhuak sung sung a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />An kâ aṭanga hremna lo chhuak mei te, meikhu te, kât te avâng chuan mihring hmun thuma ṭhena hmun khat chu an thi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Chûng sakawr thiltihtheihna chu an kâah leh an meiah a awm; an mei chu rûl ang a ni a, lu an nei a, chu chuan mi an tina ṭhîn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hêng hremna tihhlum bâk mihringte hian anmahni thilsiam biak an sim chuang lo; rangkachak te, tangkarua te, dâr te, lung te leh thinga an milim siam - eng mah hmu thei lo, eng mah hre thei lo, kal pawh kal thei hlei lote biak leh ramhuai biak an bâng chuang lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tual thah an chîn te, an dawi hman te, an hurna te, an rûkrûk te an sim hek lo.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Vântirhkoh dang, thiltithei tak, vân aṭanga lo chhuk ka hmu a, chhûmin a inthuam a, a lu-ah chhimbâl a zâm a, a hmêl chu ni ang a ni a, a kete pawh chu mei ban ang a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lehkhabu zial te tak tê inphelh sa hi a keng a. A ke ding lamin tuifinriat a rap a, a vei lam chuan khawmual a rap a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Sakeibaknei hâhum anga ringin a au va, a han au chuan khawpui ri pasarihte chuan aw an chhuah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Khawpui ri pasarihte thu sawi chu ka han ziak dâwn a, vân aṭangin aw ka hre ta a, “Khawpui ri pasarihte thu sawi kha zêp tlat la, ziak suh,” mi rawn ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuifinriat leh khawmual kârin Vântirhkoh chu a ding a, a kut ding lam chu vân lamah a phar a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />chatuana nunga, vân leh a chhûnga awm te, lei leh a chhûnga awm te leh tuifinriat leh a chhûnga awm te siamtu hming chhâlin a chham a, “A rei tawh lâwng,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />vântirhkoh pasarihnain a tawtawrâwt a ham hun chuan Pathian thurûk, a bawih zâwlneite hnêna a puan chu, a lo thleng tawh ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Vân aṭanga aw ka hriat khân mi rawn be leh a, “Tuifinriat leh khawmual kâra ding vântirhkoh kuta lehkhabu zial inphelh sa saw va la rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Vântirhkoh hnênah chuan ka kal a, lehkhabu zial tê chu ka va dîl a. Ani chuan, “La la, ei rawh, i pumah chuan a kha ang a, i kâah erawh chuan khawizu angin a thlum ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Vântirhkoh kuta lehkhabu zial chu ka la a, ka ei a; ka kâah chuan khawizu angin a thlum a, ka han lem a, ka pumah chuan a kha ta êm êm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka hnênah, “Mi te, Jentail te, ṭawng hrang hrang te leh lal tam takte hnênah Pathian thu i puang leh tûr a ni,” mi ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, luang tlâwn, tehna tiang ang hi mi pe a, “Tho la, Pathian tempul leh maichâm chu teh la, a chhûnga betute pawh chhiar rawh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tempul hung chhûng kawtlai erawh chu kân la, teh tel suh; Jentail-te hnêna pêk a ni tawh si a, Jentail-ten khawpui thianghlim chu thla sawmli leh pahnih chhûng an rapbet ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nimahsela, chûng ni sângkhat leh zahnih leh sawmruk chhûng chuan ka thuhretu pahnihte chu saiip sinin thu ka sawitîr ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hêng mite hi, oliv thing pahnih leh khâwnvâr pahnih, lei Lalpa hmaa ding ṭhînte chu an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Anni chu tihnat tuma an hmêlmaten an beih phawt chuan an kâ aṭanga mei lo chhuak chuan a kâng ral ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Thu an hril chhûng chuan ruah sûr loh nân vân an khâr thei a, tuite pawh thisenah an chantîr thei a, an duh hun hunah leiah hri tinrêng an lêntîr thei bawk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Thu an hril zawhah leilâwt aṭanga lo chhuak sakawlh chuan anni chu a do vang a, a hneh ang a, a tihlum ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />An ruang chu khaw ropui kawtlaiah chuan a lum reng ang a. Chu khawpui chu thlarau lama thlîr chuan Sodom leh Aigupta vuah a ni, an Lalpa an khenbehna khua chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />An ruang chu mi tinrêng, hnam tinrêng leh ṭawng tinrêng hmangte leh Jentail-te chuan ni thum leh a chanve chhûng an en huai huai ang a, phûm an awih lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hêng zâwlnei pahnihte hi an hnawksak êm ṭhin avângin an thi chu leia chêngte chuan an lâwm ang a, intihhlimna an siam ang a, thilpêkte an inpe tawn ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ni thum leh a chanve hnu chuan Pathian hnên ata nunna thaw an chhûngah a lût a, an ding chhuak ta mai a; a entute chuan an hlau ta êm êm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Vân aṭanga aw ring tak an hria a, “Hetah hian lo chho rawh u,” a rawn ti a; tichuan, chhûm zîngah vânah an chho ta a, an hmêlmate chuan an thlîr reng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chutih lai tak chuan lîr nasa takin a nghîng a, khawpui hmun sâwma ṭhen hmun khat chu a chim chhe ta a, lîrnghîng avâng chuan mi sângsarih an thi a; a la damte chuan an hlauh avângin, vân Pathian chu an chawimawi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Thil râpthlâk pahnihna chu a liam ta a, thil râpthlâk pathumna chu a lo thleng thuai dâwn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Vântirhkoh pasarihna chuan a han hâm a, vâna ring taka aute chuan, “Lei leh vân hi kan Lalpa leh a Mesia ram a lo ni ta. Ani chu chatuanin a lal tawh ang,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, Pathian lalṭhutthlêng hmaa ṭhu, upa sawmhnih leh palite chuan bawkkhupin Pathian chibai an bûk a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Lalpa Pathian Engkimtithei, awm mêk leh awm tawh, I thiltihtheihna ropui tak chu hmangin ro i rêl tâk avângin Kan fak a che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Jentail-te chu an thinur ta a, Mahse, i thinurna ni a lo thleng ve ta a, Mitthite chunga i rorêl ni chu. I bawih, i zâwlneite, mi thianghlimte, Milian mitê, i hming ṭihtute, Lâwmman i pêk hun leh Lei tichhetute i tihchhiat ve hun chu A thleng ta a nih hi,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Vâna Pathian tempul chu an hawng a, tempul chhûnga thuthlung bâwm chu a lo lang a; kâwl a lo phe a, aw a lo chhuak a, khawpui a lo ri a, lîr a lo nghîng a, rial te a lo tla ta dur dur a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Vânah chhinchhiahna thil mak tak, hmeichhia - nî-a inthuam, a ke hnuaia thla awm, arsi sâwm leh pahnih chuang chawimawina lukhum khum a lo lang a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nau a pai a, a vei a, a rûm a rûm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Vânah chhinchhiahna mak tak, Dragon sen lian pui, lu sarih leh ki sâwm nei, a lu-ah chawimawina lukhum pasarih khum a lo lang leh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A mei chuan vâna arsi hmun thuma ṭhena hmun khat a hâwl a, leiah a hêm thla vek a. Nau a hrin veleha lo dawlh mai tûrin hmeichhe nau vei hmaah chuan a awm ta rûn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Jentail-te chunga thîrtianga rorêl tûr fapa a hring a, a fa chu Pathian leh a lalṭhutthlêng hmaah chuan lâk chhoh a ni ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, hmeichhia chu Pathianin a buatsaihsak, thlalêrah chuan a tlân bo ta a, chutah chuan ni sângkhat leh zahnih leh sawmruk chhûng an châwm dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, vânah chuan indona a lo awm a, Mikaela leh a ho vântirhkohte chuan Dragon chu an bei a, Dragon leh a hote chuan an bei lêt ve a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />mahse, Dragon chuan a hneh ta lo va, vânah chuan an leng ve ta lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Dragon lian pui, rûlpui tar, Diabola leh Setana an tih, khawvêl pum bum ṭhîntu chu an paih chhuak a, a hote nên chuan leiah an paih thla ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tichuan, vânah ring taka au ka hria a, “Tûnah zet chuan kan Pathianin min chhan chhuak ta, a thiltihtheihzia te, a lalzia te, a Mesia thuneihzia te a lo lang ta. Kan Pathian hmaa dinga, a chhûn a zâna kan unaute hêk ṭhîntu chu vân ata paih thlâk a nih tâk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Berâmno thisen ṭana thu dik an pawm tlat avângin hnehtu an ni a, nun châna thih huam rêng an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Vân te leh a chhûnga chêngte u, lâwm rawh u. Lei leh tuifinriatte u, Diabola chu in hnênah a lo chhuk tâk avângin in chung a pik e, hun tlêm tê chauh a nei tih a hriat avângin a thinur êm êm a ni,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Dragon chuan leia paih thlâk a nih a han hriat chuan fapa hringtu hmeichhia kha a ûm ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hmeichhia chu rûlpui hmuh phâk loh thlalêrah, a awmna tûra a thlawh luh theih nân mupui lian tak thla khing hnih an pe a; chutah chuan kum thum leh a chanve an châwm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Rûlpui chuan a kâ aṭangin hmeichhe lên bo tûr lui tui anga tam tui a pik chhuak ta puat puat a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Mahse, hmeichhia chu leiin a lo chhan a, a kâ a âng a, Dragon kâ aṭanga lui lo luang chhuak chu a lem zo ta vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hmeichhe chungah chuan Dragon chu a thinur ta êm êm a, a thlah la awmte, Pathian thupêk zâwma, Isua thu rinawm taka puang ṭhîntute chu do tûrin a thawk chhuak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Dragon chu tuifinriat kamah chuan a ding ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuifinriat aṭang chuan sakawlh lo chhuak ka hmu a, ki sâwm leh lu sarih a nei a, a ki-ahte chuan lallukhum sâwm an târ bawk a, a lu-ahte chuan Pathian sawichhiatna hming a chuang ṭheuh va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka sakawlh hmuh chu keite ang a ni a, a ke chu savawm ke ang a ni a, a kâ chu sakeibaknei kâ ang a ni. Dragon chuan sakawlh chu a thiltihtheihna te, a lalṭhutthlêng te, a thuneihna nasa tak te chu a pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Sakawlh lu pakhat chu thihpui khawp hialin a hliam a; thihpui khawp hiala hliam chu a dam leh ta mai a. Khawvêl mi zawng zawngin mak an ti a, an zui huai huai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Sakawlh hnêna thuneihna a pêk avâng chuan mi tinin Dragon chu chibai an bûk a. Sakawlh pawh chu chibai an bûk bawk a, “Sakawlh ang hi tu nge awm? Tu nge do thei ang?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Pathian huatthu chaltlai taka sawia, thla sawmli leh pahnih chhûng duh tâwka a chêt an phalsak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tichuan, Pathian a sawichhe ta a, a hming te, a tempul te, vâna chêng zawng zawng te a sawichhe ta buan buan a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mi thianghlimte a do leh a hneh phal a ni a, hnam tin, mi tin, ṭawng tin leh Jentail-te chunga thuneihna pêk a ni bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Lei leh vân siam hmaa talh tawh Berâmno Nunna Lehkhabua hming chuangte chauh lo chuan khawvêla mi zawng zawngin amah chu an be dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tu pawh hriat theihna beng nei chuan ngaithla ngun rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Sala tâng tûr chu salah an tâng ang a, khandaiha thi tûr chu khandaihin an thi ang; hetah hian mi thianghlimte chu chhel tak leh rinawm taka an awm a ṭûlzia a lang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, sakawlh dang, berâm ki ang ki pahnih nei, Dragon anga thâwm na, lei aṭanga lo chhuak ka hmu a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />sakawlh hmasa thuneihna nasa tak chu a hmaah a lek ta a; sakawlh, thihpui khawp hial hliam dam leh kha, lei leh a chhûnga mi zawng zawng a biak luihtîr ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Sakawlh pahnihna chuan thil mak a ti ṭeuh va, mi tin hmuhah vân ata mei te leiah a ko thla a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />sakawlh hmasa hminga thil mak tam tak a tih phalsak a nih avângin leia mi zawng zawng a bum a; sakawlh, khandaih hliam tuar dam leh ta-a lim chu a dintîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Sakawlh lim chu a lo ṭawng theihna tûr leh, sakawlh lim be duh lo apiang a tihhlum theihna tûrin sakawlh lim tihnun theihna thu pêk a ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Sakawlh chuan mi zawng zawng, milian leh mitê, hausa leh rethei, bawih leh bawih lo te pawh an kut ding lamah emaw, an chalah emaw chhinchhiahna a nemsak a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />chuvângin, sakawlh hming emaw, a hming tlukpui nambar emaw chhinchhiahna pu lo chuan tu mahin thil an leiin an hralh thei lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hetah hian fin a ṭûl hle. Chhût thiam chuan sakawlh nambar chu chhût rawh se, mihring nambar a ni si a, a zât chu zaruk leh sawmruk leh paruk a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Zion tlângah chuan Berâmno ding ka hmu a, a hming leh a Pa hming an chala ziak mi nuaikhat leh sîngli leh sângli a bulah an ding a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Vân aṭang chuan tuifinriat ri ang leh khawpui ri dur dur ang thâwm ka hria a, ka thâwm hriat chu ṭingṭang tum miten an ṭingṭang an tum ri ang a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Lalṭhutthlêng hmaah, thilnung palite leh upate hmaah chuan hla thar an sa a, lei ata tlan chhuahte mi nuaikhat leh sîngli leh sângli chauh lo chuan chu hla chu an hre ve thei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Chûng mite chu hmeichhe laka intibawlhhlawh lo, invawng thianghlim, Berâmno kalna apianga zuitute an ni, mihring zîng ata thlan chhuah, Pathian leh Berâmno tân rah hmasate an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Dâwt an sawi ngai lo va, hmêlhemna an nei hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Vânlaizâwlan vântirhkoh dang pakhat thlâwk ka hmu a, leia chêng zawng zawng, Jentail te, hnam tinrêng te, ṭawng tinrêng te leh mi tinrêng te hnêna chatuan Chanchin Ṭha puang tûra thlâwk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ring takin a au va, “Pathian ṭih ula, chawimawi rawh u, a rorêl hun chu a lo thleng ta si a; vân te, lei te, tuifinriat te leh tuihna te siamtu chu chibai bûk rawh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Vântirhkoh dang, a pahnihna chuan a rawn zui a, “A tlâwm ta, Babulon khaw ropui, a hurna uain, hnam zawng zawng Pathian thinurna intîr ṭhîntu chu a tlâwm ta,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Vântirhkoh dang, a pathumna chuan anni chu a rawn zui a, ring takin, “Tu pawh sakawlh leh a lim chu biaa, an chalah emaw, an kutah emaw a chhinchhiahna chuang tawh phawt chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Pathian thinrimna uain fîr, a thinurnaa khat no chu an in ang a, vântirhkoh thianghlimte leh Berâmno hmaah chûng mite chu mei leh kâtin a kâng ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Anmahni hremna mei chu chatuanin a khu chho vang; sakawlh leh a lim betute leh a hming putute hremna chuan tâwpintai a nei lo vang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hetah hian mi thianghlim, Pathian thupêk avânga Isua ring tlattute tân chhel a ṭûlzia a lang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Vân aṭanga aw ka hria a: “Ziak rawh, tûn aṭangin mitthi, Lalpaa thite chu an nihlawh e,” a rawn ti a. Thlarau chuan, “Ni e, an thawhrimnate chu an chawlhsan tawh ang, an thiltihte chuan a zui dâwn si a,” a lo ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tichuan, ka han en a, chhûm vâr ka hmu a, a chungah chuan mihring ang hi a ṭhu a, chu chuan rangkachaka siam chawimawina lukhum a khum a, a kutin favah hriam tak a keng bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tempul aṭang chuan vântirhkoh dang a lo chhuak a, chhûm chunga ṭhu hnênah chuan ring takin, “I favah kha phawrh la, ât rawh; buh seng a hun ta, leia buh khu a ngui ta e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tichuan, chhûm chunga ṭhu chuan a favah chu leiah a thlâk a, leia buh chu a seng ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Vâna tempul aṭangin vântirhkoh dang a lo chhuak a, ani pawh chuan favah hriam tak a pai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Vântirhkoh dang, mei chunga thuneitu, maichâm aṭangin a lo chhuak bawk a, ring takin a au va, “I favah hriam tak kha phawrh la, leia grep khu a hmin tawh a, zu seng rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tichuan, vântirhkoh chuan favah chu leiah a thlâk a; leia grep rah bâwrte chu a hlep khâwm a, grep sâwrkhur thûk tak, Pathian thinurna khurah chuan a vawm lût a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Khawpui pâwna uain sâwrkhurah chuan grep chu a rap sâwr ta a; khur aṭang chuan thisen, sakawr thîrbarh chîm phaa thûk, km. zathum leh pasariha thui a luang ta ngûk ngûk a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, vânah chhinchhiahna dang mak tak leh ropui tak ka hmu a: Vântirhkoh pasarihin hremna hnuhnûng pasarih an rawn keng a, chûng hremnaah chuan Pathian thinrimna a thleng kim ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mei nêna inpawlh ni âwm tak tuifinriat, dârthlalang ang ka hmu a. Sakawlh leh a lim leh a hming nambar hnehtute chu ka hmu bawk a. Pathian ṭingṭang kengin dârthlalang tuifinriat kamah chuan an ding a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Pathian bawih Mosia leh Berâmno hla an sa: “Lalpa Pathian, Engkimtithei, I thiltihte chu a ropuiin a va mak êm! Hnam tin Lalber, i kawngte chu a felin a dik a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Lalpa, tu nge ṭih lo vang che-a, I hming chawimawi lo vang? Nang chauh hi mi thianghlim chu i ni, Hnam zawng zawng i hmaah lo kalin chibai an bûk ang che. I thiltih dikzia tihlan a ni ta si a,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Chumi hnu chuan ka han en a, vânah, tempul hmun thianghlim ber chu a lo inhawng a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />hremna pasarih keng vântirhkoh pasarihte chu tempul aṭang chuan an lo chhuak a; puan zai sîn vâr tle sût an sin a, rangkachak hruiin an âwm an hrêng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chatuana nung reng Pathian thinrimnaa khat rangkachak berhbu pasarih chu, thilnung palite zînga pakhat chuan vântirhkoh pasarihte chu a pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tempul chu Pathian ropuina leh a thiltihtheihna khu chuan a khat ta mup a, vântirhkoh pasarihte ken hremna pasarih chu a zawh hma chuan tu mah tempulah chuan an lût thei lo.
  </para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tempul aṭanga lo chhuak aw ring tak chuan vântirhkoh pasarihte hnênah, “Kal ula, Pathian thinrimna berhbu pasarihte chu leiah leihbaw rawh u,” a tih ka hria a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A hmasa ber chu a kal a, a berhbu chu leiah a leihbua a; tichuan, sakawlh leh a chhinchhiahna pute leh a lim betu mihringte tân pânchhia na takah a chang ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A pahnihna chuan a berhbu chu tuifinriatah a leihbua a; tichuan, thisen, mitthi thisen ang maiah a chang ta a; tuifinriata nungcha awm zawng zawng chu an thi zo ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A pathumna chuan a berhbu chu luiahte leh tuikhurahte a leihbua a, thisenah a lo chang ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tui vântirhkoh chuan, “Awm mêk leh Awm tawh, Nang, mi thianghlim, ro i rêl dik ngei mai;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />mi thianghlimte leh zâwlneite thisen chhuahtute chu thisen i intîr ve tâk thung hi; in âwm rêng an ni,” a tih ka hria a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Maichâm aṭang chuan, “Ni e, Lalpa, Pathian Engkimtithei, i rorêlna chu a dikin a fel a ni,” tih aw ka hre bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A palina chuan a berhbu chu ni-ah a leihbua a; ni chu mei saa mihringte em uh an phalsak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tichuan, mei sa-in mite chu a em ût ta a; mahse, chûng hremna chunga thuneitu Pathian hming chu an sawichhia a, an sim lo va, amah an fak duh hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A pangana chuan a berhbu chu sakawlh lalṭhutthlêngah a leihbua a, a ram chu a lo thim ta vek a; an na tuar chu an ṭhen tlawk tlawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />An pân vei leh an na tuar avâng chuan vân Pathian chu an sawichhia a, an thiltihte chu an sim chuang lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A parukna chuan a berhbu chu Eufretis luipuiah chuan a leihbua a, a tui chu a kang ta a; khawchhak lam aṭanga lal lo kal tûrte tân kawng a inhawng ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, Dragon kâ aṭang te, sakawlh kâ aṭang te, zâwlnei der kâ aṭangtea lo chhuak thlarau bawlhhlawh pathum, chungu ang ka hmu bawk a. Chûng chu ramhuai thlarau an ni a, thil mak pawh an ti ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Pathian Engkimtitheia ni ropuia indonaa hruai khâwm tûrin khawvêl lal zawng zawng hnênah an kal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ngai teh u, rûkru angin ka lo kal e, inringa inchei peih diama awm chu a nihlawh e, saruaka a awm miten an hmuha a zah loh nân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hebrai ṭawnga Harmegadon an tih hmunah an rawn hruai khâwm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A pasarihna chuan a berhbu chu boruakah a leihbua a, tempula lalṭhutthlêng aṭang chuan aw ring tak a lo chhuak a, “A zo ta,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Kâwl a phe a, aw a lo chhuak a, khawpui a ri dur dur a, lîr na takin a nghîng a, mihring awm china lîrnghîng azawngah a la na ber.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Khaw ropui chu hmun thumah a lo phel a, Jentail khawpuite a chim a, Babulon khaw ropui chu Pathianin a hre reng a, a thinurna no chu a intîr ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Thliarkâr zawng zawng a bo va, tlângte pawh hmuh tûr a awm tawh lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Vân aṭangin rial lian pui pui, kg. sawmnga dâwn laia rit, mihring chungah a tla a. Riala hremna avâng chuan Pathian chu miten an sawichhia a, hremna chu a na êm êm mai si a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Berhbu pasarih keng Vântirhkoh pasarihte zînga pakhat chu a lo kal a, mi rawn bia a, “Hawh teh, tui tam tak chunga ṭhu, nawhchizuar hmingthang tak chunga rorêlna chu ka hmuhtîr ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Leia lalte chuan an tawmpui ṭhîn a, leia chêngte pawh a hurna zu chuan a hrai rui ṭhîn,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tichuan, Thlarauvin thlalêrah mi hruai a, sakawlh senlâr chunga chuang hmeichhia ka hmu a. Sakawlh taksa pumah chuan Pathian huatzâwng hming a chuang buai a, lu sarih leh ki sâwm a nei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hmeichhia chu puan senduk leh senlârin a inthuam a, rangkachak ṭhi te, lungmantam te, tuikeplung tein a inchei a. A kutin thil tenawm leh a hur bawlhhlawhnaa khat rangkachak no a keng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A chalah chuan awmze rûk nei, ‘Babulon khaw ropui, khawvêl nawhchizuarte nu, mi tenawmte nu,’ tih a chuang a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chu nu chu mi thianghlimte thisen leh Isua avânga martarte thisena a rui ka hmu a. Amah ka han hmuh chuan mak ka ti êm êm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Vântirhkoh chuan, “Engati nge mak i tih? He nu leh a phurtu sakawlh lu sarih leh ki sâwm nei thurûk chu ka hrilh ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Sakawlh i hmuh hi a awm tawh zet a, a awm leh ta lo va; leilâwt aṭangin a lo chhuak leh ang a, boralnaah a lût leh mai dâwn. Lei leh vân siam hmaa Nunna bu-a hming ziak loh leia chêngte chuan, sakawlh chu a awm tawh zet a, a awm leh ta lo va, a lo awm leh tûr chu mak an ti ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hei hi hriatthiam a ṭûl hle. Lu sarih chu hmeichhe ṭhutna tlâng sarih a ni a, lal pasarih an ni bawk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Panga chu an thi tawh a, pakhat chu a la awm a, a dang erawh chu a la awm rih lo; a lo awm hunah pawh rei lo tê chauh a awm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Sakawlh, awm tawh zeta awm leh ta lova chu a pariatna a ni, pasarihte zînga mi kha a ni bawk; mahse, tihboral a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />ki sâwm i hmuh kha lal sâwm, la lal ve lote an ni, anni chuan dârkâr khat chhûng chauh sakawlh nên lal anga thuneihna an nei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Inthurualin an thuneihna leh an thiltihtheihna chu sakawlh hnênah an pe ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Anni chuan Berâmno chu an do vang a; mahse, Berâmno chuan a hneh ang: a hnung zuitu, a kohva a thlan, mi rinawmte nên chuan anni chu an hneh ang, ani chu lalte Lal, lalberte Lalber a ni si a,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ka hnênah a sawi zêl a, “Nawhchizuar ṭhutna tui tam tak i hmuh kha mi te, mipui te, Jentail-te leh ṭawng hrang hrang te an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />I sakawlh hmuh leh a ki sâwmte chuan nawhchizuarnu chu an hua ang a, a silhfên an hlîp vek ang a, saruakin an hnutchhiah ang. A sa chu an ei ang a, meiah an rawh ral ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Pathianin a thiltih tum ti tûrin an rilru a hneh a, Pathian thu a thlen kim hma chu sakawlh hnênah an lalna pêk an remti tlâng a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />I hmeichhe hmuh kha, khawpui ropui, leia lalte chunga lal chu a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chûng hnuah chuan vântirhkoh dang vân aṭanga lo chhuak ka hmu leh a. Thuneihna nasa tak a nei a, a ropuina chuan lei pum pui a ên a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ring takin, “A tlâwm ta, Babulon khaw ropui chu a tlâwm ta. Ramhuaite chênna, thlarau bawlhhlawhte inkulhna leh sava bawlhhlawh tenawm tinrêng tawm khâwmna hmun a lo ni ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A uirena, thinurna uain chu Jentail-ten an in a, leia lalte chuan ani chu an tawmpui a, a nawmsak bâwlna chu leia sumdâwngtuten an hausak phah ṭhîn,” tiin a au va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Vân aṭanga aw dang ka hre leh a: “Ka mite u, chhuahsan rawh u, A sualnaahte tel ve suh u, hremna hi in tuar ve dah ang e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A sualna chuan vân a tawng a, Pathianin a thil sual tih chu a hre reng a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />In chunga a tih ang chiahin a chungah ti ve ula, a thiltih zawng zawng a lêtin thungrûl rawh u. In tûra a buatsaih leh hniha tak a novah chuan chhûnsak rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A intihropui leh a nawmsak bâwl ang hu tuarna leh lungngaihnain thungrûl rawh u. ‘Lalnuah ka ṭhu a, hmeithai ka ni lo ve, lu ka sûn ngai lo ve,’ a ti rilru vei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Chuvâng chuan, ni khat chhûng maiin hremna a tuar dâwn, thih te, lusûn te, ṭâm te, meia hâl ral te a tuar bawk ang. Thiam loh chantîrtu chu Lalpa Pathian Chaka a ni,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Leia lal, amah uirepuitu, nawmsak bâwlpui ṭhîntute chuan a kâng khu an hmuh chuan an ṭap ang a, khawpui chu an ṭah ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A hremna chu tuar ve an hlauh avângin hla takah an thlîr ang a, “E heu! A va râpthlâk êm! Babulon khaw ropui leh chak tak chu, Dârkâr khat chhûng lekin a chhiat tâk hi!” an ti ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Leia sumdâwngtute pawhin an ṭah ang a, amah an sûn ang; tu man an zawrh sumte an leisak ta si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Rangkachak te, tangkarua te, lungmantam te leh tuikeplung te, puan zai sîn te, puan senlâr leh duk te, maimaw puan te, thing rimtui chi hrang hrang te, saingho te, dâr te, thîr te leh sailungvâra siam thil chi hrang tinrêng te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />thakthîng te, mawsawla te, beraw te, mura te, rimtui hâl chi te, uain leh oliv hriak te, chhangphut leh a hûm te; sebâwng leh berâm te, sakawr leh tawlailîr te, bawih te leh mihring nunna an zawrh ṭhin te chu tu man an leisak tawh lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Sumdâwngtute chuan, “I thei duhzâwng, i châk ṭhinte kha a awm ta lo; i ropuina leh i mawina zawng zawng a bo ta, i nei leh ngai tawh hauh lo vang,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Chutianga sumdâwng mi, khawpuia sumdâwnga intihausate chuan a hremna tuar chu tuar ve an hlauh avângin hla takah an ding a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“E heu! A va râpthlâk êm! Khawpui ropui, puan zai sîn, senduk leh senlâra inthuama, Rangkachak ṭhi te, lungmantam te leh tuikeplung tea Inchei ṭhîn chu!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Dârkâr khat chhûng lekin a hausakna a ral tâk vek hi!” an ti a. Lawng hotu te leh a chhûnga khualzin te, lawng khalhtu te leh tuifinriata hna thawktu te pawh hla takah an ding a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A kâng khu an hmuh chuan an au va, “He khua ang khawpui ropui dang a awm dâwn em ni?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />An lu-ah vaivut an phul a, an ṭah a, “E heu! A va râpthlâk êm! Tuifinriat lawng zawng zawng chu, He khawpui hausak zâra hausa an ni a, dârkâr khat chhûng lekin A ram tâk hi!” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Aw vân te, mi thianghlim te, tirhkoh te, zâwlnei te u, a chhiat tâk avângin lâwm rawh u; in chunga a thil tihte avângin Pathianin a hrem ta a nih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Vântirhkoh chak tak hian chhangphut râwtna lung tiat zeta lian lung a la a, tuifinriatah a paih a, “Babulon khaw ropui chu hetiang hian vawm pil a ni ang a, tu man an hmu leh tawh hauh lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ṭingṭang te, phênglâwng te, tawtawrâwt te I chhûngah an tum ri dâwn tawh lo. Thil tinrêng siam thiam hmuh tûr tu mah an awm lo vang a, Buh her thâwm hriat tûr a awm hek lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Khâwnvâr êng hmuh tûr a awm lo vang a, Mo leh a pasal hlim thâwm hriat tûr a awm hek lo vang. I sumdâwngtute khawvêl milian an ni a, I dawiin Jentail-te i bum si ṭhîn,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Mi thianghlim te, zâwlnei te leh leia an thah zawng zawng thisen a chhûngah chuan chhuah a ni ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chûng hnuah chuan vânah mipui nasa tak aw ang ka hria a: “Haleluia, chhandamna te, ropuina te, thiltihtheihna te kan Pathian ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A rorêl chu a dik a, a ṭha a ni, Nawhchizuar hmingthang, a hurnaa khawvêl tibawlhhlawhtu chu, Thiam loh a chantîr ta. A bawihte thisen a chhuahsak ṭhin avângin phuba a la ta a nih hi,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Haleluia, a kâng khu chu chatuanin a chho vang,” an ti leh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Upa sawmhnih leh pali leh thilnung palite chu an bawkkhup a, lalṭhutthlênga ṭhu Pathian chu chibai an bûk a, “Amen, Haleluia,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, lalṭhutthlêng ata aw lo chhuak chuan, “Nangni a chhiahhlawh, milian leh mitê, amah ṭihtute u, kan Pathian hi fak rawh u,” a rawn ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mipui nasa tak aw ang, tuifinriat ri hum hum ang, khawpui ri hluah hluah ang thâwm ka hria a: “Haleluia, Lalpa kan Pathian Engkimtitheia chuan ro a rêl e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hlimin lâwm ila, i chawimawi ang u, Berâmno nupui neih a hun tâk hi; A nupui tûr pawh a inpeih tawh a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Puan zai sîn vâr tle takin an thuam ta. Puan zai sîn chu mi thianghlimte thil ṭha tihte hi a ni,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, ka hnênah, “Ziak rawh, Berâmno nupui neihna ruai ṭheh tûra sâwmte chu an nihlawh e,” a ti a. “Hêng thute hi Pathian thu dik a ni,” a ti bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A ke bula bawkkhupin chibai ka bûk ta a. Ka hnênah, “Khatin ti suh, nang leh Isua thu pawmtu, i unaute nêna in bawihpui mai ka nih hi. Pathian chibai bûk zâwk rawh, Isua thu rawn hril hi thuhriltîrtu thlarau a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, vân a lo inhawng a, sakawr vâr ka hmu a, a chunga chuang hming chu “Rinawma leh Dika” a ni, dik taka rorêlin râl a bei ṭhîn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A mit chu meialh ang a ni a, a lu-ah chuan lallukhum tam tak a khum a, tu ma hriat ve loh amah chauhvin a hriat hming ziak a pu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Kawr, thisena hnim a ha a, a hming chu ‘Pathian Thu-a’ a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Vân sipai rual puan zai sîn vâr tle taka inthuamte chuan sakawr chunga chuangin a hnung an zui a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A kâ aṭang chuan khandaih hriam tawn hriam tak a lo chhuak a, chu chuan Jentail-te a hneh ang a, thîrtiangin an chungah ro a rêl ang. Amah hi a ni Pathian Engkimtitheia thinurna nasa tak uain sâwrna khura rap sâwrtu tûr chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A kawrah leh a malpuiah chuan hming “Lalte Lal, Hotute Hotu,” tih a chuang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, vântirhkoh pakhat ni-a ding ka hmu a, vânlaizâwla sava thlâwk ṭhîn zawng zawng hnênah ring takin, “Pathian ruai ropui ṭheh tûrin lo kal rawh u;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />lal sa te, sipai hotu sa te, mi huai sa te, sakawr leh a chungchuang sa te, bawih leh bawih lo, milian leh mitê, an zavaia sa in ei dâwn nia,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Sakawlh leh lei lalte chu an sipaite nên chuan sakawr vâr chunga chuang leh a sipaite bei tûrin an kal khâwm ka hmu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Sakawlh chu an man a, a mit hmuha thil mak ti ṭhîn zâwlnei der pawh chu an man a. Chu Zâwlnei chuan a thil tih makin sakawlh nambar pute leh a lim betute chu a bum ṭhîn a ni. An pahnih chuan a nung chungin kâta kâng meidîlah chuan an paih ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Sakawr chunga chuang kâ aṭanga khandaih lo chhuak chuan mi dangte pawh chu thah an ni a; savate chuan an sa chu puar takin an ei ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, vân aṭanga Vântirhkoh pakhat lo chhuk ka hmu a, leilâwt chabi leh khaidiat lian tak a keng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Dragon, Rûlpui Tar, Diabola leh Setana chu a man a, kum sâng tâng tûrin a phuar a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />kum sâng a ral hma chu hnamte a bum tawh loh nân leilâwtah chuan a thlâk a, a kalh khum a, a châr hnan ta a. Chumi hnuah erawh chuan rei lo tê an chhuahtîr leh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, Lalṭhutthlêng ka hmu a, a chunga ṭhute chu ro an rêltîr a. Isua thu an hril avâng leh Pathian thu avânga lu tante thlarau ka hmu a, sakawlh leh a lim be ve lo, an chalah emaw, an kutah emaw a chhinchhiahna awm ve lote thlarau ka hmu bawk a. Chûng chu an lo nung leh a, Krista hovin kum sâng ro an rêl ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mitthi dangte erawh chu kum sâng a ral hma chuan an nung leh ve rih lo. Hei hi thawhlehna hmasa chu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Thawhlehna hmasaa telte chu an thianghlimin an nihlawh e. Thih hnihna chuan an chungah thuneihna a nei tawh lo. Pathian leh a Krista tân puithiam an ni ang a, a hovin kum sâng an lal ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kum sâng a ral hnu chuan a tânna ata Setana chu an chhuah ang a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />lei kil li-a Jentail-te, Gog leh Magog chu a rawn bum ang a, indonaah a hruai khâwm ang; an tam lam chu tuifinriat kama ṭiauvaivut anga tam an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Lei pum dâpin an lo chho va, mi thianghlimte kulh leh a khawpui duh tak chu an hual a; mahse, vân ata mei a lo sûr a, anni chu a kâng ral ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Anmahni bumtu Diabola chu, Sakawlh leh zâwlnei der awmnaah, kâta kâng meidîlah chuan an paih a, chutah chuan a chhûn a zânin hrem an tuar kumkhua tawh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Lalṭhutthlêng vâr ropui tak leh a chunga ṭhu ka hmu a, a hma ata lei leh vân an tlân bo va, hmuh tûr a awm tawh lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mitthite, milian leh mitê, lalṭhutthlêng hmaa ding ka hmu, lehkhabu zialte an pharh a; tin, lehkhabu zial dang, nunna bu an pharh ka hmu bawk a; mitthite chu chûng lehkhabua an thiltih ziak ang zêl chuan an chungthu rêl a ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuifinriat chuan a chhûnga mitthite chu a chhuah a, thihna leh mitthi khua pawh chuan mitthi an kawlte chu an chhuah bawk a; mi tin an thiltih ang zêlin an chungthu rêl a ni ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Thihna leh mitthi khua chu meidîlah an paih a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />He meidîl hi thih hnihna chu a ni. Tu pawh Nunna bu-a an hming an hmuh loh chu meidîlah chuan an paih a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, vân thar leh lei thar ka hmu a, vân hmasa leh lei hmasa chu a awm tawh lo va, tuifinriat pawh a awm tawh hek lo
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Khaw thianghlim, Jerusalem thar chu, mo pasal nei tûra inchei diam anga inpeih, Pathian hnên ata vân aṭanga lo chhuk ka hmu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Lalṭhutthlêng ata aw ring tak ka hria a, “Ngai teh, Pathian chênna chu mihring zîngah a lo awm ta: An zîngah a chêng ang a, a mite an ni ang. Pathian ngei chu an hnênah a awm ang a, an Pathian a ni bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />An mit ata mittui zawng zawng a hru hul ang a, Thih a awm leh tawh lo vang. Lu sûn te, ṭah te, nat te pawh a awm tawh hek lo vang. Thil hluite chu a liam ta a,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Lalṭhutthlênga ṭhu chuan, “Ngai teh, thil engkim ka siam thar e,” a ti a. “Ziak rawh, hêng ka thute hi a rinawmin a dik a ni,” a ti leh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka hnênah, “A lo thleng ta, kei Alfa leh Omega, a bul leh a tâwp ka ni. Tuihâl apiang hnênah nunna tuikhura mi a thlâwna in tûr ka pe ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A hnehtute chuan hêng hi an chang dâwn: An Pathian ka ni ang a, ka tân fapa an ni bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mi dawihzep te, ring lo te, tenawm te, tual that te, inngaih chîng te, dawithiam te, milem bia te leh dawthei zawng zawng te chan tûr erawh chu kâta kâng meidîl a ni, chu chu thih hnihna chu a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin berhbu pasarih, hremna hnuhnûng pasariha khat keng vântirhkoh pasarih zînga pakhat chu ka hnênah a lo kal a, “Lo kal teh, Berâmno nupui, a mo chu ka lo entîr ang che,” mi ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Thlarauvin tlâng lian pui sâng takah mi hruai a, Jerusalem, khawpui thianghlim chu Pathian hnên ata vân aṭanga lo chhuk mi entîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Pathian ropuina a khum a, a ên dân chu lungmantam jaspi lung, krustal anga fîm a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kulh bang chhah tak, sâng tak a nei a, kawngkhâr sâwm leh pahnih a awm a, kawngkhârte chu vântirhkoh sâwm leh pahnihin an vêng a; chûng kawngkhârahte chuan hming ziak a awm - Israel fa hnam sâwm leh pahnihte hming chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chhak lamah kawngkhâr pathum, hmâr lamah kawngkhâr pathum, chhim lamah kawngkhâr pathum, thlang lamah kawngkhâr pathum a awm ṭheuh va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Khawpui kulh bang chuan innghahna lungphûm sâwm leh pahnih a nei a, chutah chuan Berâmno tirhkoh sâwm leh pahnihte hming a chuang bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mi betu chuan khawpui leh a kawngkhârte leh kulh bang teh nân rangkachaka siam tehna tiang a keng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Khawpui chu kil li nei, a dung lam leh a vâng lam inbial a ni a, tiang chuan a han teh a. Km. sânghnih leh zali a sei a ni. A dung leh a vâng leh a sân lam chu a inchen vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A kulh bang chu mihring tehna hmangin vântirhkoh chuan a han teh a, metar sawmruka chhah a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A kulh bang atân jaspi lung an hmang a, khawpui chu dârthlalang anga fîm rangkachak thianghlima din a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Khawpui kulh bang lungphûm chu lungmantam chi hrang hrang a ni a, lungphûm pakhatna chu jaspi lung a ni a, a pahnihna chu safir lung a ni a, a pathumna chu kalkedon lung a ni a, a palina chu smaragdin lung a ni a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />a pangana chu sardonuk lung a ni a, a parukna chu sardoni lung a ni a, a pasarihna chu kruso lung a ni a; a pariatna chu berul lung a ni a, a pakuana chu topaz lung a ni a, a sâwmna chu krusopras lung a ni a, a sâwm leh pakhatna chu huakintho lung a ni a, a sâwm leh pahnihna chu amethus lung a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Kawngkhâr sâwm leh pahnihte chu tuikeplung sâwm leh pahnih, tlang khat ṭheuhva siam a ni. Khawpui kawtlai chu rangkachak thianghlim dârthlalang anga fîm a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Khawpui chhûngah chuan tempul ka hmu lo. Lalpa Pathian Engkimtitheia leh Berâmno chu an tempul a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Khawpui ên tûrin ni leh thla a ngai lo, Lalpa ropuina chuan a ên a, an khâwnvâr chu Berâmno a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Jentail-te chu a êngah chuan an lêng ang a, leia lalte pawhin an ropuina an rawn luhpui ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />A kawngte chu chhûnah an khâr ngai lo vang a, zân a awm tawh hek lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Jentail-te chuan an ropuina leh chawimawina an rawn luhpui ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Thil bawlhhlawh eng mah a lo lût thei hek lo vang a, thil tenawm tite leh dâwt chîngte an lo lût thei hek lo vang; Berâmno nunna bu-a hming chuangte chauh an lût thei ang.
  </para>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, nunna lui mi entîr a; krustal anga fîm a ni, Pathian leh Berâmno lalṭhutthlêng aṭangin a lo luang chhuak a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />khawpui lai taka kawtthlêrah chuan a luang tlang a, a kam tuakah chuan nunna thing, rah chi hrang sâwm leh pahnih nei a awm, thla tin a rah a, a hnahte chu hnam tin tihdamna a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ânchhe dawng thil eng mah a awm tawh lo vang; tah chuan Pathian leh Berâmno lalṭhutthlêng a inhûng ang a, a bawihte chuan a rawng an bâwl ang a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />a hmêl an hmu reng ang; an chalah chuan a hming a chuang bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Zân a awm tawh lo vang a, khâwnvâr leh ni êng an ngai tawh hek lo vang, Lalpa Pathian chuan a ên dâwn si a, chatuan chatuanin an lal tawh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka hnênah, “Hêng thute hi a rinawmin a dik a ni, Lalpa Pathian, zâwlneitea thu sawitu chuan thil lo thleng thuai tûr a bawihte entîr tûrin vântirhkoh a rawn tîr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ngai teh, ka lo kal thuai dâwn e; he lehkhabua hrilhlâwkna thu zâwmtute chu an nihlawh e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hêng hretu leh hmutu hi kei Johana hi ka ni. Ka hriata ka han hmuh chuan hêng thil mi entîrtu vântirhkoh ke bulah chuan chibai bûk tûrin ka bawkkhup a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ani chuan “Khatin ti suh, kei chu i bawihpui, zâwlneite leh he lehkhabu thu zâwmtute bawihpui ve mai ka nih hi, Pathian chibai bûk zâwk rawh,” mi ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ani chuan ka hnênah, “He lehkhabua hrilhlâwknate hi zêp suh, a hun a lo thleng ṭêp a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mi sualte chu sual zêl sela, mi bawlhhlawhte chu bawlhhlawh zêl sela, mi ṭha chu ṭha zêl sela, mi thianghlim pawh thianghlim zêl mai rawh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ngai teh, ka lo kal thuai dâwn e; mi tin an thiltih ang zêla pêk tûrin lâwmman ka hnênah a awm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Kei hi Alfa leh Omega, hmasa ber leh hnuhnûng ber, a bul leh a tâwp chu ka ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />An puan su faite chu an nihlawh e, khawpui chhûnga lûtin nunna thinga mi an ei thei dâwn si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ui te, dawithiam te, inngaih chîng te, tual that te, milem bia te, dâwt sawi chîng leh ngaina zawng zawngte erawh chu a pâwnah an awm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Kei Isua hian, kohhrante hêng thu hrilh tûrin ka vântirhkoh ka rawn tîr a nih hi; Davida zungzâm, a thlah, vârparh arsi êng chu ka ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Thlarau leh mo chuan, “Lo kal rawh,” an ti a. A hria apiang pawhin, “Lo kal rawh,” ti ve rawh se. Tuihâl apiang lo kal sela, nunna tui duh apiangin a thlâwnin han in rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />He lehkhabua hrilhlâwkna thu hria apiang ka hriattîr e: miin hêng thute hi an belhchhah chuan, Pathianin he lehkhabua hremna sawite hi a belhchhah ve ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tu pawhin he lehkhabua hrilhlâwkna thute hi an lâk bo chuan, he lehkhabua ziak nunna thinga mi leh khaw thianghlima an chan tûr chu Pathianin a lâksak ve ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hêng thu puangtu hian, “A ni, ka lo kal thuai dâwn e,” a ti a. Amen, Lalpa Isu, lo kal ta che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Lalpa Isua khawngaihna chu mi tin hnênah awm rawh se.
  </para>
</usx>
